      "message": "If we look at the specification, the ReadDescriptorReq/Rsp are mapped to ReadAttributeReq/Rsp: core spec 5.3 Vol 3 Part G 4.13 (Page 1524).\nIt could make sense to mapped it directly here.But if we want to keep them separate we should rename `ReadDescriptorReq/Rsp` to `ReadCharateristicDescriptorReq/Rsp` to be closer to the specification.\n\nThus said, for someone who doesn\u0027t know how GATT is working in detail, keeping `ReadCharacteristicDescriptorReq/Rsp` should be more obvious.",
